PUSHOFF 2
STOREOFF 2
PUSHOFF 1
PUSHIMM 0
ADD
PUSHOFF 1
STOREIND
PUSHOFF 1
PUSHIMM 1
ADD
PUSHOFF 2
STOREIND
end_Calculator_new_196:
POPFBR
JUMPIND
Calculator_add:
ADDSP 0
PUSHOFF -1
PUSHIMM 1
ADD
PUSHIND
PUSHOFF -1
ADD
STOREOFF 2
PUSHIMM 0
JUMP end_Calculator_add_197
end_Calculator_add_197:
STOREOFF -3
ADDSP -0
JUMPIND
