PUSHIMM 1
ADD
PUSHIND
JUMP end_Calculator_getResult_201
end_Calculator_getResult_201:
STOREOFF -2
ADDSP -0
JUMPIND
Main_main:
ADDSP 4
PUSHIMM 0
LINK
PUSHIMM 2
MALLOC
PUSHIMM 10
PUSHIMM -1
TIMES
PUSHSP
PUSHIMM 3
SUB
PUSHFBR
JSR Calculator_new
POPFBR
ADDSP -2
STOREOFF -1
POPFBR
STOREOFF 2
PUSHIMM 0
PUSHOFF 1
PUSHIMM 10
LINK
JSR Calculator_add
POPFBR
ADDSP -2
STOREOFF 1
PUSHOFF 1
PUSHIMM 0
EQUAL
JUMPC then_204
else_205:
PUSHIMM 0
PUSHOFF 1
PUSHIMM 6
LINK
JSR Calculator_add
POPFBR
ADDSP -2
STOREOFF 1
JUMP next_206
then_204:
PUSHIMM 0
PUSHOFF 1
PUSHIMM 5
LINK
JSR Calculator_add
POPFBR
ADDSP -2
STOREOFF 1
next_206:
